","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","number":23,"title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2978,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-05-22T16:25:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T16:23:23Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-01-26T18:09:14Z"},"comments":2,"created_at":"2025-10-13T19:19:50Z","updated_at":"2025-11-15T02:25:53Z","closed_at":"2025-11-14T20:28:28Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111612","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111612","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111612.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111612.patch","merged_at":"2025-11-14T20:28:28Z"},"body":"Currently, when exporting a file from Godot with an integer accessor type, it looks like this:\r\n\r\n```json\r\n{ \"bufferView\": 3, \"componentType\": 5126, \"count\": 24, \"max\": [1.0, 1.0], \"min\": [0.0, 0.0], \"normalized\": false, \"type\": \"VEC2\" },\r\n{ \"bufferView\": 4, \"componentType\": 5121, \"count\": 36, \"max\": [23.0], \"min\": [0.0], \"normalized\": false, \"type\": \"SCALAR\" },\r\n{ \"bufferView\": 5, \"componentType\": 5126, \"count\": 11, \"max\": [5.0], \"min\": [0.0], \"normalized\": false, \"type\": \"SCALAR\" },\r\n{ \"bufferView\": 6, \"componentType\": 5121, \"count\": 11, \"max\": [1.0], \"min\": [0.0], \"normalized\": false, \"type\": \"SCALAR\" }\r\n```\r\n\r\n5126 means single-precision float (32-bit float), and 5121 means unsigned byte (8-bit integer). The `\"max\": [23.0], \"min\": [0.0]` values are not technically wrong, since JSON just has \"number\", but they are misleading. This PR changes the serialization of accessors with integer data types to use integer min/max values, so it would look like this:\r\n\r\n```json\r\n{ \"bufferView\": 3, \"componentType\": 5126, \"count\": 24, \"max\": [1.0, 1.0], \"min\": [0.0, 0.0], \"normalized\": false, \"type\": \"VEC2\" },\r\n{ \"bufferView\": 4, \"componentType\": 5121, \"count\": 36, \"max\": [23], \"min\": [0], \"normalized\": false, \"type\": \"SCALAR\" },\r\n{ \"bufferView\": 5, \"componentType\": 5126, \"count\": 11, \"max\": [5.0], \"min\": [0.0], \"normalized\": false, \"type\": \"SCALAR\" },\r\n{ \"bufferView\": 6, \"componentType\": 5121, \"count\": 11, \"max\": [1], \"min\": [0], \"normalized\": false, \"type\": \"SCALAR\" }\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis helps with KHR_node_visibility, because it needs to encode accessors as unsigned byte (8-bit unsigned integers).","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111612/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111612/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}